00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.367
Vectors used to need a graph
It took three graph commands, build, export search and embed. The last one now says where it went.

2
00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:25.167
Pages to vectors, one step
The site's 268 pages become 3174 vectors, every one computed fresh. No graph.ttl is written.

3
00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:35.367
Search by meaning
The top hits are the concept of pinning a fact to a sentence and the page that teaches it.

4
00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:39.900
Same ids as the graph
Every hit is a graph node IRI, so the graph, its chunks and the vectors join on one id.

